<title>SINGAPORE: HARIMAU HALF-YEAR NET PROFIT UP 43 PCT.</title>
<headline>HARIMAU HALF-YEAR NET PROFIT UP 43 PCT.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-08-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30, 1997</p>
<p>		   (in millions of S$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit			    3.06   vs    2.13</p>
<p>    Group shr (cents)		   5.10   vs    3.55</p>
<p>    Operating income		    4.71   vs    3.33</p>
<p>    Dividend and interest income    2.15   vs    1.53</p>
<p>    Gains from sale of investments  2.32   vs    1.47</p>
<p>    Other trading profit		0.23   vs    0.34</p>
<p>    Operating profit		    3.76   vs    2.37</p>
<p>    Profit before tax		   3.76   vs    2.54</p>
<p>    Tax				     0.70   vs    0.41</p>
<p>Note - Full name of company is Harimau Investments Ltd.</p>
